      plan:{frequency:'Every 2–3 weeks during creative workflow optimization',next:'Test faster mode switch without adding sustained breath hold.',rationale:'OT task analysis integrates ergonomic load, access efficiency and meaningful creative occupation.',training:'Keyboard-free recovery strategy and shoulder pacing.',outcome:'Tool-switch time decreased; mouse fallback reduced to 1 per session.'},
